<speak>
<s>This is your Jumu'ah briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">29052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The United Nations has formally named Israel in its annual report on conflict-related sexual violence, citing verified incidents against Palestinian detainees.</s> <s>That report is the mechanism by which states, not only armed groups, are placed on the permanent record for abuse committed in war.</s> <s>Israel has cut all contact with Secretary-General Guterres... whose term now ends amid the rupture.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Sudan's two warring generals marked Eid with rival visions of the same nation.</s> <s>Army chief El Burhan vowed to keep fighting Hemedti's Rapid Support Forces even as he called for national dialogue, while Hemedti declared a new Sudan from the ground he holds.</s> <s>African Union talks open on the third of June, but Burhan has excluded the very forces that control most of Khartoum.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Chad's Supreme Court dissolved the country's main opposition coalition a day before sentencing eight of its leaders to eight years without parole for planning a protest march.</s> <s>Jailing an entire opposition slate, pre-emptively, for a march that never happened is how a managed transition hardens into one-party rule.</s> <s>The African Union and the UN have urged dialogue; President Déby's government hasn't responded, and no election date is set.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistani authorities arrested eleven social media activists across Punjab, with the cyber-crime agency invoking anti-state powers it was originally built to fight financial fraud.</s> <s>Turning a fraud unit's emergency clause against critics already under surveillance widens the net from crime into dissent itself.</s> <s>Its director said the crackdown will continue with what he called strict legal action.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The International Criminal Court has set former Philippine president Rodrigo Duterte's trial for crimes against humanity on the thirtieth of November.</s> <s>Manila quit the court's founding treaty in twenty-nineteen, but judges ruled that conduct before the exit remains triable, and he faces three counts tied to at least seventy-six killings.</s> <s>He's the first former Asian head of state to stand before the court.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sweden will donate sixteen Gripen fighter jets to Ukraine and sell it twenty more, financed through a two-and-a-half billion euro European loan.</s> <s>Saab's Gripen is built to operate from dispersed road bases — it can land on a highway — which matches Ukraine's tactic of surviving Russian strikes on its airfields.</s> <s>The newer jets are slated for later delivery.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Talks to renew the Nuclear Nonproliferation Treaty collapsed for a third time, even as Russia and the United States test-fired intercontinental ballistic missiles during the conference itself.</s> <s>New START expired in February, leaving no verification regime to count either side's warheads for the first time in decades.</s> <s>The conference chair warned that another failure could unravel the treaty altogether.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>China now dominates both ends of the global value chain, holding the cheapest rungs and the most advanced ones at once.</s> <s>For decades, poorer nations climbed out of poverty by starting with low-wage exports and moving upmarket — but with one country occupying both, that ladder is closing for late industrialisers.</s> <s>Manufacturing hopefuls in Bangladesh and Nigeria may find the path that lifted earlier economies has narrowed to a thread.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A leading business voice in South Africa warned that companies stepping in to replace a failing state risk entrenching that very failure.</s> <s>When private capital absorbs the government's obligations, it strips away the state's own incentive to improve and breeds dependency, the head of Business Leadership South Africa said.</s> <s>Volkswagen alone supports fifty thousand indirect jobs in one struggling region.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The United States ranked dead last for healthcare again, across twenty wealthy nations.</s> <s>Private-payer fragmentation leaves it with roughly a third the primary-care doctors per person of its peers, and alongside Mexico it's one of only two without universal coverage, the Commonwealth Fund found.</s> <s>The problem isn't money — America spends the most — it's how that spending is structured.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In the Democratic Republic of Congo, an Ebola outbreak is growing just as Washington says it won't repatriate Americans who catch the virus.</s> <s>Outbreaks are contained upstream, by clinicians moving toward the disease, so stranding foreign volunteers raises the odds the virus travels further than it otherwise would.</s> <s>European hospitals are now being lined up to evacuate aid workers instead.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>British researchers studying the Sun's current cycle have found magnetic shifts beneath its surface that existing models simply can't explain.</s> <s>The data show more magnetism deep down but fewer sunspots above, a mismatch that breaks the dynamo theory used to predict solar storms.</s> <s>Those forecasts protect satellite navigation and power grids, so a blind spot here reaches all the way to Earth.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers have shown that a weak acid can pull lithium out of ordinary silicate rock, bypassing the energy-hungry kiln that conventional processing demands.</s> <s>The team behind it projects costs under six thousand dollars a metric ton, competitive with drawing lithium from brine.</s> <s>A pilot plant is planned by the end of next year, God willing, with mining partners already in talks.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A widely used Java software library was caught shipping hidden code designed to sabotage artificial intelligence assistants.</s> <s>Because coding agents now read a project's dependency files as instructions, every library a project pulls in becomes a channel for injecting commands into its AI.</s> <s>The German developer who planted it disclosed the move in release notes after pushback, and says he's consulting a lawyer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The AI company Anthropic will release its Mythos model to all users within weeks, expanding it beyond a three-partner preview.</s> <s>That model carries offensive cybersecurity capabilities the company's own executives and several world leaders have warned are dangerous.</s> <s>No release date is fixed, and no American law restricts who may use those features.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Apple's long-delayed AI version of Siri may now run on a distilled copy of Google's Gemini.</s> <s>Distillation trains a small model to imitate a much larger one, trading some accuracy for the privacy and speed of running on the device — yet routing requests through Google and Nvidia cuts against Apple's own privacy promise.</s> <s>The feature has slipped since twenty-twenty-four.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>